WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:08.260
In this lesson, you will learn to change the number on a block to move more than one square, and choose the fewest blocks.

2
00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:10.960
Each arrow block has a number.

3
00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:14.310
It tells the cat how many squares to move.

4
00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:16.920
Tap the number and pick a new one.

5
00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:20.320
Right 3 moves three squares right.

6
00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:24.220
One block with 3 is shorter than three blocks with 1.

7
00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:26.770
Short code is neat code!

8
00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:28.640
Count the squares to the goal.

9
00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:31.080
Then put that number on the block.

10
00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:34.290
Get the dog to the star with just ONE block.

11
00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:39.210
Right 4 — one block did the job of four!

12
00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:41.480
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

13
00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:46.230
Now build along, then try the challenges. You’ve got this!
